{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-taurus-ttx-suppressor-lineup/","version_id":"cbae06cee6683b38a886cd7ea33241d8f78a7bd55473a10f5aa66c8b77585684","decision":"reject","reason":"Exclusions and Making the decision prohibit suppressor coverage, including this announcement of three Taurus models. Under Commercial incentives and Credibility, the gas-flow, recoil and sound-reduction claims come from Taurus through a commercial publication, without independent testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/amaris-cerra-claims-bronze-in-junior-women-s-skeet-at-2026-issf-junior-world-cup-porpetto/","version_id":"4bf3eedaac5e7c1fab231c91aa0c088b7befe49f3bc862efdbf801052a896fab","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this report of junior skeet scores and medal results offers no evidence about eligible gear or Mammoth carrying conditions. The source is identified as commercial, but no specific product sponsorship is disclosed in the article.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/longshot-app-update-cuts-lag-and-brings-audio-from-the-target/","version_id":"57f334546fa9e00ac0f546513d805e5fa18b74c3561a9030b356287b38cc97d2","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this target-camera software announcement concerns reviewing paper-target range sessions and establishes no connection to gear carried or used under Mammoth conditions. Commercial incentives and Credibility also identify the latency improvements as manufacturer claims relayed by a commercial publication, without measured testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/vincent-hancock-tops-usa-shooting-men-s-skeet-national-team-ranking/","version_id":"5934fa715c3c203237cd5b0e1c69a29e9e01e21732a41fa774380d07d8688d6e","decision":"reject","reason":"Relevance and Making the decision exclude this national-team ranking report because it provides no eligible gear evidence or Mammoth suitability findings. Under Commercial incentives, the article explicitly promotes Federal Ammunition's sponsored athletes and quotes its marketing executive praising the ammunition it supplies.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/for-its-500th-beretta-makes-the-92fs-a-work-of-art/","version_id":"8fd39400a14ca52575465090666ddc49a6c77982ac47990604f42a39622a979f","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Exclusions and Making the decision, this feature centers on a firearm, the diamond-and-gold Beretta 92FS, rather than eligible competitor gear. Commercial incentives and Credibility apply to its manufacturer quotations and untested engineering claims; the collector craftsmanship supplies no Mammoth suitability evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-sk-guns-charro-negro/","version_id":"3482edd41dc9f44679d0161ed7d913448fca90381a48bdb1b1e3c717d148e79f","decision":"reject","reason":"Exclusions prohibit this coverage of a decorated Colt 1911 firearm, while Relevance and Making the decision also reject its preorder promotion and urgency about limited edition numbers. Under Commercial incentives, the article relays SK Guns' founder's promotional statements and directs readers to purchase the $3,000 collector pistol.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/accuracy-x-m45a2-battle-pistols-are-tribute-to-marines-m45a1/","version_id":"53d8ef6676e3e848c066db52e006d4004448282370ba2dc66d14999a4219adb7","decision":"reject","reason":"Exclusions and Making the decision prohibit this firearm-centered announcement of Accuracy X's limited edition M45A2 pistol; bundled accessories do not make it an eligible gear review. Under Commercial incentives, the company president's tribute narrative, remaining inventory, price and ordering instructions establish a direct promotional purpose.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/range-usa-s-newest-store-opens-this-weekend-in-smyrna-tenn/","version_id":"b32c019c194620980c285863c1b3d895722c17a4f46ff6a4c8098dd144136050","decision":"reject","reason":"Relevance and Making the decision reject this indoor-range opening promotion, which describes 25-yard lanes, classes, memberships and giveaways rather than Mammoth gear evidence. Under Commercial incentives, it promotes Range USA's retail business and quotes its CEO encouraging attendance.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/vortex-pro-cantilever-mounts-turn-one-base-into-a-system/","version_id":"e5eef8d946ac222f72d745c19aff79873b1c8a9b369f85c6f11dd0ada6facf2a","decision":"accept","reason":"Relevance, Freshness and novelty, and Credibility support Piece 01: the new scope-mount family provides specific manufacturer-claimed tube sizes, heights, accessory compatibility and prices relevant to coordinating optics and rangefinders. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, flag Vortex's Mammoth sponsorship and the commercial announcement's manufacturer sourcing; it provides no independent evidence of durability or field effectiveness.","piece_ids":["01"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/inside-the-tandemkross-adx-race-rifle/","version_id":"0ff07347e8a3787382dd6735f29271a461a226c85c0c69b9dfba0f8349666def","decision":"reject","reason":"Exclusions and Making the decision prohibit this coverage of complete firearms, an SBR, and stock and action features, including field-stripping instructions. Under Commercial incentives, the article promotes Tandemkross' new product family, prices and manufacturer durability claims; its rimfire competition focus does not supply eligible Mammoth gear evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
